OL,3,GNEWSASocial meet-ups group lets women
OL,4,Atry new activities
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the Ponds Forge sports centre in
OL,7,FSheffield, a group of 30 women are
OL,8,Fjumping off diving boards - many for
OL,9,Fthe first time.
OL,11,FThe session has been organised by Soul
OL,12,F& Social Club, a community for women
OL,13,Fthat runs activities and meets-ups to
OL,14,Freduce loneliness and isolation.
OL,16,FGolf, pilates, pottery, tennis, glass
OL,17,Fpainting, gymnastics and ballet are
OL,18,Famong the other pastimes members can
OL,19,Ftry, but today the focus is in
OL,20,Fspringboard diving for all abilities.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
