OL,3,GNEWSASocial meet-ups group lets women
OL,4,Atry new activities
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event is billed as a
OL,7,F"judgement-free zone" with guidance
OL,8,Ffrom coaches, and costs just #10. More
OL,9,Fthan 100 women have taken part in the
OL,10,Fmonthly sessions so far.
